},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Gioni Papuc:625:TEXT_EMOTE:|h|cffff7c0aGioni Papuc|r|h moos at Kaga Wildhoof. Mooooooooooo.",
["id"] = "s0_1684",
["timestamp"] = 1795814259,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Tauren",
["name"] = "Christos Renaste",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["level"] = 6,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE",
["type"] = "EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "With arms flapping, |Hplayer:Christos Renaste:626:TEXT_EMOTE:|h|cff0070ddChristos Renaste|r|h struts around Kaga Wildhoof.  Cluck, Cluck, Chicken!",
["id"] = "s0_1685",
["timestamp"] = 1795814270,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Tauren",
["name"] = "Christos Renaste",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["level"] = 6,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE",
["type"] = "EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "With arms flapping, |Hplayer:Christos Renaste:628:TEXT_EMOTE:|h|cff0070ddChristos Renaste|r|h struts around Kaga Wildhoof.  Cluck, Cluck, Chicken!",
["id"] = "s0_1686",
["timestamp"] = 1795814275,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kaga Wildhoof",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kaga Wildhoof says: Go on and have a seat near the fire and we can get started.",
["id"] = "s0_1687",
["timestamp"] = 1795814285,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kaga Wildhoof",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kaga Wildhoof says: All you need to start a camp of your own is a basic campfire. Cooks can generally teach you how to make one of those.",
["id"] = "s0_1688",
["timestamp"] = 1795814291,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kaga Wildhoof",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kaga Wildhoof says: Once your campfire is down, you can place all sorts of camp fixtures around it.",
["id"] = "s0_1689",
["timestamp"] = 1795814298,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kaga Wildhoof",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kaga Wildhoof says: Sufficiently skilled leatherworkers, for example, can place a tent like this one behind me.",
["id"] = "s0_1690",
["timestamp"] = 1795814304,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Tauren",
["name"] = "Aox Naasen",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "WARRIOR",
["level"] = 5,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE",
["type"] = "EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "You fall asleep.  Zzzzzzz.",
["id"] = "s0_1691",
["timestamp"] = 1795814306,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kaga Wildhoof",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kaga Wildhoof says: Every trade has something they can contribute to your camp, even fishermen!",
["id"] = "s0_1692",
["timestamp"] = 1795814311,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kaga Wildhoof",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kaga Wildhoof says: Then, all you need to do is have a seat near the fire and soak it all in. After a few minutes of resting, you'll gain various boons that will help you in your travels.",
["id"] = "s0_1693",
["timestamp"] = 1795814317,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kaga Wildhoof",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kaga Wildhoof says: If you just sit still and rest for a few more moments, you'll gain a benefit from having rested near the tent I have set up behind me.",
["id"] = "s0_1694",
["timestamp"] = 1795814327,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kaga Wildhoof",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kaga Wildhoof says: That's about the gist of it. Once you've gained your boon from resting near the fire, speak with me again.",
["id"] = "s0_1695",
["timestamp"] = 1795814336,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Aox-Naasen",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_SKILL",
["type"] = "SKILL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.3333333432674408,
["r"] = 0.3333333432674408,
},
["text"] = "You have gained the First Aid skill.",
["id"] = "s0_1696",
["timestamp"] = 1795814459,
},
